WEBVTT

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:02.033
Meet Ino Loyalty.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:06.233
Set how points are earned, spent, and when they expire.

00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:11.300
Reward your best customers with tiers and perks of their own.

00:00:12.967 --> 00:00:18.300
Launch a campaign in five steps: name it, pick who qualifies, set the rules,

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.100
test it on a sample basket, and publish.

00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:31.933
Build segments from real shopping behaviour, explained in plain words.

00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:37.500
Every member in one view: balance, tier, purchases, consents,

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.533
and a branded wallet card.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.367
Track outstanding points, liability and expiry at a glance.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:50.700
For developers: signed webhooks, an event catalog and a real-time API.

00:00:51.433 --> 00:00:52.800
Privacy is built in.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:56.733
Erasure requests are reviewed, then completed end to end.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.733
Ino Loyalty, by Tryino.
